RegMAS - Regional Multi Agent Simulator
Info: http://regmas.org/doc


***** NEWS *****

20091022
Noversion
Added possibility to load farmers on specific sub-regions

20080930
Version 1.3.0
Introduced option for stochastic simulations
Premium decoupled from activities (each activity can have nn premium associated, each one with its own reference period and contribution to SFP calculation)
healthCheck scenario refers now to the Health Check as in the 20 May 2008 EU Commission Comunication

20080731
Repository moved from CVS to Subversion

20080520
Version 1.2.0
New data loading method. Now data is loaded directly from the OpenDocument Spreadsheet file, without needs of first exporting in CSV/XML.
Scenario is not choosed in the GUI trough a pop-up menu.
Add options (-hcis) to the command line version.

20080216
Version 1.1.0
New policy options (regionalisation and more modulation classes)
New command line version (as the GUI change the seed of the random numbers)
Corrected spatial object initialisation (now by plot and no longer by agent, when plots not owned or rented by an agent were not initialised)

20080117
Version 1.0.0
Corrected various bugs in visualisation, input data, effects of leaving farms.

200801XX
Version 0.9.3 (Release Candidate 3)
GUI enchangments: zoom/pan, handle between GUI elements
In subregion mode, shown and saved only the subregion

20071225
Version 0.9.1 (Release Candidate 2)
Option to export maps as images

20071127
Version 0.9.0 (Release Candidate 1)
Added policy variables and scenarios switch.
Agents seems to behave like expected, all (discovered) bugs fixed.

20071005
Version 0.5.1
The model "scheleton" is now complete: agents are initialized and correctly act in the model (eventually leaving if not competitive enought).
The licence is upgraded to GPL V.3.

20070707
Version 0.4.0
Agents are now able to "think" solving a MIP problem using glpk.
New server and some CVS history losted (about one month)

20070423
Version 0.13:
GUI switched to Qt, as it include XML support and easy txt I/O.
Get rids also of gdal requirement.. now needed only Qt and GLPK as external libraries.

20061023
Version 0.12:
Introduced the GUI (wxWidgets). Up to now just a log window.

